  "details": "1. Enable Windows Smart App Control.\n\n2. Install VRChat through Steam.\n\n3. Launch VRChat from the Steam Library.\n\n4. Easy Anti-Cheat starts the launch process.\n\n5. Windows Code Integrity blocks `VRChat.exe` with Event ID 3077.\n\n6. VRChat fails to launch and displays the error: \"The game executable path is invalid.\"\n\nThe issue persists after verifying the integrity of game files, deleting the `Cache-WindowsPlayer` folder, and restarting the PC.",
